and fostering a sense of community. The combination of its unique gameplay mechanics and social features makes RyeVen 2 a must-play for anyone seeking adventure and camaraderie in a virtual world.", "short_description": "RyeVen 2 Is a very fun game where you can swing around with your arms and hang out with your friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicyryeven2/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Venakry", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ryeven2/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8244049009021264"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035371_487740160817078_4581166938424330217_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rtm3b4OO69QQ7kNvwED3W-8&_nc_oc=Admwfe_cZknnZPmpQ5Wua6x4EuZsBM6H_J7-g4Ft3EFZjYHR9wU3zzxpKm-F3nfgnwI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuw9t_4GaQUTBKfTTS_ILr9BLVc-Rpe8Dy6VfbDyE3N0Q&oe=69A189B7"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "RyeVen 2", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}], "release_date": 1724723